# Demo mode: leave empty (uses mockData in the browser)
# Production / local Worker API:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL="http://localhost:8787"

# Production uses same-origin /api (no env var needed when deployed)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECURITY: never add secrets here. Any `VITE_`-prefixed variable is inlined
# into the public JavaScript bundle and is readable by every visitor.
#
# Super Admin credentials are Worker-side only:
#   wrangler secret put SUPERADMIN_PHONE
#   wrangler secret put SUPERADMIN_PIN
#   wrangler secret put SUPERADMIN_USERNAME
#   wrangler secret put SUPERADMIN_PASSWORD
#
# Owner publishing payments (Cashfree) are Worker-side only — see
# docs/payments.md. Without them the checkout runs in simulation mode:
#   wrangler secret put CASHFREE_APP_ID
#   wrangler secret put CASHFREE_SECRET_KEY
#   wrangler secret put CASHFREE_WEBHOOK_SECRET
#
# Market-ready integrations (P0) — all optional, all fail closed:
#   CASHFREE_* (same keys as above) also enable token/rent/deposit payment
#   links and the /api/market/webhooks/cashfree webhook. Without them owners
#   record UPI/NEFT/cash manually with a UTR reference.
#   WhatsApp BSP / KYC provider / e-Sign credentials are NOT wired to env vars
#   yet — their adapters (src/domain/messaging.ts, src/domain/trust.ts) run in
#   deep-link / state-only mode until a provider is chosen.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
